WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:04.750
<b>Role playing. To act out a character.</b>

00:05.330 --> 00:07.580
<b>As I looked down at the children's playground,</b>

00:07.580 --> 00:11.250
<b>I altered my personality and voice to walk
among them as another piece on the board.</b>

00:11.920 --> 00:15.420
<b>The role I chose to pass my time
with was "ordinary townsgirl".</b>

00:15.960 --> 00:19.250
<b>And it was the perfect fit, given
the contract that I had made with Horn.</b>

00:19.960 --> 00:21.920
<b>While I was away being Syr,</b>

00:22.290 --> 00:26.040
<b>she would fulfill her dream of becoming
a Goddess through a spell that she'd manifested.</b>

00:26.580 --> 00:29.130
<b>At other times, I would share part
of my consciousness with her</b>

00:29.130 --> 00:30.830
<b>so that she could fill in as Syr.</b>

00:31.500 --> 00:35.670
<b>Although, those instances were rare enough
that I can count them on one hand.</b>

00:36.670 --> 00:40.750
<b>What a surprise to see you here in that form.
I understand you have a wish to make?</b>

00:42.960 --> 00:44.960
<b>Living as Syr was quite fun.</b>

00:45.540 --> 00:49.830
<b>Cleaning and cooking were a challenge. I soon realized
that I wasn't as dexterous as I had believed.</b>

00:50.290 --> 00:52.080
<b>Still, I found it enjoyable.</b>

00:53.130 --> 00:55.210
<b>I adore beautiful things.</b>

00:55.670 --> 00:59.330
<b>Especially the ones that live beautifully
for the sake of something aside from themselves.</b>

00:59.920 --> 01:01.330
<b>The stray kitten.</b>

01:01.630 --> 01:03.500
<b>The lonely black cat.</b>

01:03.710 --> 01:05.630
<b>The girl seeking a place to belong.</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:08.290
<b>The Elf trying to stay on the path of sincerity.</b>

01:08.540 --> 01:10.460
<b>They are all my precious darlings.</b>

01:11.670 --> 01:13.960
<b>But then, I came across him...</b>

01:14.380 --> 01:16.040
<b>that boy and his translucent soul.</b>

01:17.830 --> 01:20.170
<b>That drove me to throw it all away.</b>

01:20.580 --> 01:23.460
<b>My honor, my pride, and even the void inside me.</b>

01:24.670 --> 01:26.040
<b>Which is why...</b>

01:27.500 --> 01:28.880
<b>I killed Syr.</b>

01:32.630 --> 01:34.580
<b>Bell! Is everything okay?!</b>

01:37.080 --> 01:39.630
<b>Bell. Where's Syr?</b>

01:39.960 --> 01:45.460
<b>Ms. Syr is okay now.
The Freya Familia left and everything's all right...</b>

01:47.380 --> 01:49.580
<b>What do you mean it's all right?</b>

01:49.960 --> 01:53.790
<b>Where did Syr go? And why was
the Freya Familia even after her?!</b>

01:54.830 --> 01:55.790
<b>Take it easy!</b>

01:56.170 --> 01:58.250
<b>Bell... what's wrong?</b>

02:08.210 --> 02:13.250
<b>The story of today, sometimes the world is irony</b>

02:13.500 --> 02:17.380
<b>"Nevertheless..." In my heart</b>

02:17.380 --> 02:22.960
<b>I found this feeling and now it's our world</b>

02:32.420 --> 02:37.880
<b>I've been here since that day, continually seeking and searching</b>

02:38.130 --> 02:44.670
<b>Whenever I encounter weaknesses,
I have to overcome them one after another</b>

02:44.670 --> 02:48.670
<b>Fighting back tears each time</b>

02:48.920 --> 02:53.710
<b>Then getting back up for tomorrow
and the day after, that's how I've lived</b>

02:53.880 --> 02:59.000
<b>Having faith in the past and advancing beyond it</b>

02:59.170 --> 03:03.960
<b>Where something irreplaceable is waiting for us</b>

03:04.170 --> 03:08.670
<b>The story of adventure, it can begin today</b>

03:08.960 --> 03:14.750
<b>To prevent anyone from glorifying the tragic elegy</b>

03:15.130 --> 03:19.630
<b>Ah, I want to become strong, our counterattack begins</b>

03:19.750 --> 03:23.170
<b>It's okay to be uncool</b>

03:23.540 --> 03:29.250
<b>Ah, encounters are love, so that's where you've been, huh?</b>

03:38.040 --> 03:41.790
<b>Freya Familia</b>

03:38.040 --> 03:41.790
<b>Invasion</b>

03:38.630 --> 03:42.000
<b>Let me get this straight, you're saying
the Syr we saw was an imposter?!</b>

03:42.210 --> 03:47.380
<b>Yes. The Freya Familia were never
trying to kill the actual Syr.</b>

03:47.830 --> 03:50.210
<b>Okay, then. What about the real Syr?</b>

03:50.880 --> 03:55.130
<b>I met up with her.
And Ms. Syr professed her love for me...</b>

03:59.540 --> 04:00.830
<b>but I turned her down.</b>

04:00.960 --> 04:01.500
<b>Huh?</b>

04:02.080 --> 04:03.080
<b>But why?!</b>

04:03.380 --> 04:04.790
<b>Why would you do that?!</b>

04:05.210 --> 04:07.710
<b>How could you reject her heartfelt feelings?!</b>

04:09.330 --> 04:12.790
<b>I know you! You're not the type
of person who would do that!</b>

04:13.130 --> 04:15.960
<b>Because then... nobody, not even me...</b>

04:16.630 --> 04:18.460
<b>My heart is set on someone else.</b>

04:19.920 --> 04:23.170
<b>It's a person who I've always been watching.
And trying to catch up to.</b>

04:23.710 --> 04:26.830
<b>Because someday, I want to become
equals and tell her how I feel...</b>

04:27.670 --> 04:31.420
<b>That's why even if Ms. Syr loves me...
I can't reciprocate her feelings.</b>

04:35.540 --> 04:37.580
<b>How did it never occur to me?</b>

04:37.920 --> 04:43.580
<b>You're already captivated with someone else,
just like how Syr was with you. And that's totally natural.</b>

04:45.330 --> 04:46.540
<b>Please allow me to apologize.</b>

04:47.040 --> 04:49.920
<b>I got all bent out of shape without
even considering how you felt.</b>

04:51.630 --> 04:53.880
<b>Syr still hasn't come back to the tavern.</b>

04:54.380 --> 04:56.210
<b>So I'm leaving to go find her.</b>

04:57.380 --> 04:59.460
<b>Then I'll join you.</b>

05:08.920 --> 05:11.790
<b>We've finally been freed from working at the tavern...</b>

05:12.330 --> 05:15.080
<b>but it just doesn't feel right to go have fun at the festival.</b>

05:15.580 --> 05:19.790
<b>They won't be able to do much business
after Lady Anya and the others got hurt so badly.</b>

05:20.080 --> 05:23.040
<b>I can't believe they got attacked by the Freya Familia.</b>

05:24.170 --> 05:26.460
<b>Not to mention that Lady Syr is still missing.</b>

05:26.460 --> 05:28.670
<b>It's hard to make any sense out of what's going on.</b>

05:29.040 --> 05:33.130
<b>Well, we've already been dragged into the deep end.
We might as well keep poking our nose into it.</b>

05:33.670 --> 05:35.750
<b>I'm curious about what the Freya Familia is up to.</b>

05:36.080 --> 05:37.920
<b>Let's split up and find that missing waitress.</b>

05:44.630 --> 05:47.880
<b>I'm willing to bet Hermes' theory was right.</b>

05:50.420 --> 05:54.130
<b>That Syr girl we saw is both
a Goddess and not a Goddess.</b>

05:54.710 --> 05:58.830
<b>She's basically an empty vessel who
Freya allowed to serve as her substitute.</b>

05:59.710 --> 06:02.880
<b>And if she's been Syr the whole time, then that's fine.</b>

06:03.460 --> 06:09.500
<b>The real problem is, what if the Syr who's been
interacting with my Bell was actually Freya all along?</b>

06:10.170 --> 06:14.250
<b>Because if Freya has been regularly using Syr's
appearance to get close to Bell, then...</b>

06:16.080 --> 06:20.040
<b>I need to be sure. For starters, I'll go meet with
Hermes again and get his advice.</b>

06:20.040 --> 06:20.920
<b>Hestia.</b>

06:23.330 --> 06:24.290
<b>Freya!</b>

06:24.960 --> 06:28.630
<b>I'd like to have Bell. Give him to me, would you?</b>

06:28.960 --> 06:31.290
<b>Huh?! You can't be serious!</b>

06:31.500 --> 06:32.830
<b>There's no way I'm going to agree to that!</b>

06:32.830 --> 06:33.920
<b>Listen, Hestia.</b>

06:34.460 --> 06:36.670
<b>You're one of the ones I adore.</b>

06:38.380 --> 06:42.750
<b>The eternal flame of the hearth that you preside
over is more valuable than any sort of gold.</b>

06:43.040 --> 06:45.460
<b>You could even go as far as to say that I fear it.</b>

06:45.750 --> 06:47.750
<b>I don't want to resort to any violence.</b>

06:48.040 --> 06:49.420
<b>So please, Hestia.</b>

06:49.960 --> 06:51.630
<b>Just let me have Bell, okay?</b>

06:51.830 --> 06:52.790
<b>Not happening.</b>

06:53.290 --> 06:54.380
<b>You won't budge no matter what?</b>

06:54.380 --> 06:57.500
<b>That's right! Bell belongs to my Familia!</b>

06:57.500 --> 06:59.380
<b>He's one of my precious children!</b>

06:59.670 --> 07:01.210
<b>I'm never let you have him!</b>

07:01.630 --> 07:03.880
<b>Okay. Then you leave me no choice.</b>

07:10.750 --> 07:12.380
<b>I'll be taking him by force.</b>

07:25.580 --> 07:27.880
<b>The hell do you think you're doing?!</b>

07:28.130 --> 07:30.210
<b>Lady Aisha?! Why are you here?</b>

07:30.460 --> 07:32.540
<b>My patron God told me to keep watch on you guys.</b>

07:32.880 --> 07:34.960
<b>He also ordered me not to interfere, but...</b>

07:35.330 --> 07:37.500
<b>protecting you is more important than that!</b>

07:37.790 --> 07:39.170
<b>Try to stop us and...</b>

07:39.460 --> 07:40.460
<b>we'll crush you!</b>

07:48.000 --> 07:49.880
<b>Their infinite chain of attacks is too much!</b>

07:50.080 --> 07:52.170
<b>I have to do something so at least Haruhime can escape!</b>

07:52.460 --> 07:54.170
<b>You think you can protect this Renard?</b>

07:57.250 --> 07:59.210
<b>You've already failed, fool.</b>

08:01.000 --> 08:01.830
<b>Lady Aisha...</b>

08:09.580 --> 08:10.750
<b>I remember you!</b>

08:17.460 --> 08:19.500
<b>So are you here to fight me, or what?!</b>

08:19.830 --> 08:22.210
<b>No, dumbass. Fight's already over.</b>

08:24.080 --> 08:24.920
<b>You sonuva...</b>

08:27.750 --> 08:31.960
<b>That was a solid attack. I take pride in seeing
more brethren like you rise up in the world.</b>

08:33.920 --> 08:35.790
<b>I can still hit him with my magic sword!</b>

08:36.040 --> 08:39.000
<b>However, luck is far from being on your side.</b>

08:43.880 --> 08:45.710
<b>It's The King! Why are you here?!</b>

08:46.080 --> 08:49.920
<b>Just surrender. The divine will
of our Goddess calls for you.</b>

08:50.250 --> 08:52.040
<b>Your destiny has already been written.</b>

08:53.580 --> 08:55.960
<b>Try to resist it, and I'll take you down.</b>

08:57.170 --> 08:58.460
<b>Run away, Bell!</b>

09:02.420 --> 09:03.170
<b>Ms. Ryu!</b>

09:18.630 --> 09:21.130
<b>Lion... Bell Cranel...</b>

09:27.420 --> 09:31.380
<b>Resigned to both crime and punishment. We shall
shoulder all of the slander and condemnation.</b>

09:31.710 --> 09:34.330
<b>For the Mistress of our pledged fealty has made a wish.</b>

09:34.330 --> 09:36.830
<b>Hence we emerge as servants who implement divine will.</b>

09:37.790 --> 09:40.080
<b>And should the Goddess ever desire it...</b>

09:40.540 --> 09:42.750
<b>then all meaning shall come to naught.</b>

09:44.330 --> 09:46.080
<b>What have you done, Freya?</b>

09:46.580 --> 09:49.460
<b>I had my children launch an attack on your children.</b>

09:50.080 --> 09:51.540
<b>The battle is already over.</b>

09:52.040 --> 09:52.920
<b>What?!</b>

09:54.670 --> 09:55.580
<b>Oh no...</b>

10:01.420 --> 10:02.210
<b>Bell!</b>

10:04.880 --> 10:06.330
<b>Not so fast, Hestia.</b>

10:08.580 --> 10:10.880
<b>He's no longer yours to touch as you please.</b>

10:11.540 --> 10:12.630
<b>Freya...</b>

10:13.170 --> 10:14.130
<b>It's like I told you.</b>

10:14.380 --> 10:15.880
<b>I'm taking him by force.</b>

10:16.880 --> 10:18.960
<b>My time as Syr is over.</b>

10:19.380 --> 10:23.170
<b>So then, it really was you parading
as her at the tavern all along!</b>

10:23.670 --> 10:25.000
<b>What an absolute joke!</b>

10:25.000 --> 10:28.830
<b>You couldn't handle getting rejected by Bell
so you lash out by pulling this crazy stunt?!</b>

10:29.000 --> 10:31.960
<b>Pathetic for someone who's supposed
to be the "Goddess of Love"!</b>

10:33.500 --> 10:35.580
<b>Exactly. I tried as Syr and failed.</b>

10:35.960 --> 10:38.000
<b>So now I'm pulling out all the stops.</b>

10:38.420 --> 10:40.460
<b>Rescind your vow with Bell.</b>

10:40.960 --> 10:42.040
<b>Say what?!</b>

10:42.540 --> 10:45.790
<b>I'm telling you to get ready for a conversion.</b>

10:46.210 --> 10:49.250
<b>Refuse my demands and I'll have your children killed.</b>

10:49.920 --> 10:53.630
<b>If that's not enough to get you to cooperate,
then I'll see you sent back to Heaven.</b>

10:54.290 --> 10:57.630
<b>You can kick up a fuss,
but Bell will be mine sooner or later.</b>

10:58.080 --> 11:01.750
<b>It all ends the same way. So make the smart choice.</b>

11:02.290 --> 11:04.040
<b>Bell, or your Familia?</b>

11:06.710 --> 11:08.500
<b>You know, I've always wondered...</b>

11:08.790 --> 11:12.420
<b>if there could be anything more terrifying than
the carnage of a Goddess on the warpath.</b>

11:12.790 --> 11:13.750
<b>Hermes!</b>

11:13.750 --> 11:16.960
<b>Hey, Hestia. Let me guess...</b>

11:17.170 --> 11:22.040
<b>Lady Freya is finally making a power play to try
and force Bell over to her side, is that it?</b>

11:22.290 --> 11:24.630
<b>That's right, so don't interfere.</b>

11:24.920 --> 11:27.210
<b>If you're here to try and muddy the waters,</b>

11:27.210 --> 11:29.830
<b>then I'll start by making sure you get sent to Heaven first.</b>

11:29.830 --> 11:33.290
<b>Okay. I'll admit I can't do anything to stop you.</b>

11:33.790 --> 11:35.460
<b>So you can go ahead and take Bell.</b>

11:35.630 --> 11:37.750
<b>Huh?! Are you nuts, Hermes?!</b>

11:37.830 --> 11:41.040
<b>But... you'll have to wait a bit for the conversion.</b>

11:41.500 --> 11:44.710
<b>It's only been half a year since
Bell joined the Hestia Familia.</b>

11:45.250 --> 11:48.330
<b>And members of a Familia have
to be active for at least one year</b>

11:48.330 --> 11:51.250
<b>before they can undergo a conversion to a different one.</b>

11:51.580 --> 11:54.750
<b>That's one of the rules for the Lower World
that we Gods settled upon, right?</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:57.250
<b>Bell is yours to take with you.</b>

11:57.540 --> 12:00.330
<b>Heck, you can even pretend
he's already with your Familia if you want.</b>

12:00.580 --> 12:03.040
<b>I'll smooth things over with
the Guild in that respect, too.</b>

12:03.290 --> 12:05.000
<b>Hermes! That's ridiculous!</b>

12:05.000 --> 12:07.130
<b>Sorry, you gotta admit defeat on this one.</b>

12:07.500 --> 12:10.580
<b>Especially since I've given you the chance
to reach a decent compromise here.</b>

12:10.750 --> 12:11.500
<b>Huh?</b>

12:14.130 --> 12:17.210
<b>Fine by me. I'd prefer to avoid pointless sacrifices.</b>

12:17.330 --> 12:19.500
<b>So I'll go along with your coaxing.</b>

12:20.790 --> 12:24.250
<b>Thank you. Your mercy is appreciated, Goddess of Love.</b>

12:24.630 --> 12:25.750
<b>Just one thing.</b>

12:25.750 --> 12:30.920
<b>I'll be taking a few proactive steps to make sure that the
conversion happens when the time comes.</b>

12:32.040 --> 12:34.750
<b>Don't try and break your promise, Hestia.</b>

12:35.540 --> 12:36.380
<b>But my Bell...</b>

12:36.710 --> 12:38.080
<b>Tough it out for now.</b>

12:38.540 --> 12:42.540
<b>With half a year, we can put together some kind of plan.</b>

12:42.920 --> 12:46.210
<b>Despite everything that's going on, I find myself
wanting to see Bell stick around with you, Hestia.</b>

12:46.670 --> 12:48.130
<b>Although it's just a whim.</b>

12:48.540 --> 12:51.130
<b>But... what did she mean by "proactive steps"?</b>

12:51.380 --> 12:52.330
<b>I'm not sure.</b>

12:52.710 --> 12:56.130
<b>Nothing seems beyond Lady Freya at this point,
even going straight to the her last resort...</b>

12:58.000 --> 12:58.880
<b>Uh oh!</b>

12:59.830 --> 13:00.750
<b>Master Hermes!</b>

13:01.630 --> 13:05.460
<b>A vast amount of the townsfolk have assembled at
Central Park in response to a summons from the Guild!</b>

13:06.080 --> 13:07.920
<b>They've even prepared megaphones.</b>

13:08.500 --> 13:10.710
<b>It's almost like someone is about to give a speech.</b>

13:12.080 --> 13:15.710
<b>What is all this about?
What is the Freya Familia plotting?!</b>

13:16.540 --> 13:18.460
<b>Hestia! Boost your divinity!</b>

13:18.830 --> 13:19.500
<b>Huh?</b>

13:19.750 --> 13:21.210
<b>As high as you can, right now!</b>

13:21.540 --> 13:23.880
<b>Otherwise it will even override your innate ability!</b>

13:23.880 --> 13:26.080
<b>Wh-what's the matter with you all of a sudden?</b>

13:26.330 --> 13:28.420
<b>I thought we were going to plan for half a year first...</b>

13:28.420 --> 13:30.040
<b>We don't have the luxury of that anymore!</b>

13:30.420 --> 13:34.420
<b>I misjudged the situation! Lady Freya is more
hell-bent on her desire than I thought!</b>

13:34.750 --> 13:39.830
<b>She'll go to any length for her one and only Ord!
Even forfeiting the rule that she imposed on herself!</b>

13:40.330 --> 13:42.790
<b>Asfi! Grab Ryu and escape right now!</b>

13:42.960 --> 13:45.960
<b>Fly as far away from Orario as you can possibly get!</b>

13:46.460 --> 13:47.210
<b>But, sir...</b>

13:47.210 --> 13:49.460
<b>Just do what I say before it's too late!</b>

13:50.630 --> 13:51.500
<b>All right!</b>

13:56.670 --> 13:59.290
<b>When the time is right, you need to give this to me.</b>

13:59.750 --> 14:01.210
<b>Don't try and do it immediately!</b>

14:01.540 --> 14:04.880
<b>If you screw up the timing,
then I'll just end up being your enemy instead!</b>

14:05.540 --> 14:07.830
<b>Y-you want me to give you this...?</b>

14:08.000 --> 14:13.040
<b>Yes! Out of everyone in Orario right now,
the only one who can resist what's coming is you, Hestia!</b>

14:13.580 --> 14:14.670
<b>Hold on, Hermes.</b>

14:14.920 --> 14:17.750
<b>Are you saying that what Freya's about to do is...?</b>

14:18.250 --> 14:21.040
<b>I'm going to tell you all a very boring story.</b>

14:22.460 --> 14:25.130
<b>I saw to it that Ishtar went back to Heaven.</b>

14:25.580 --> 14:29.880
<b>She lost all her elegance and
became too ugly to bear looking at.</b>

14:30.630 --> 14:32.000
<b>That's why I got rid of her.</b>

14:32.960 --> 14:34.130
<b>And now...</b>

14:34.500 --> 14:38.000
<b>I'm on the verge of becoming
someone just as ugly as her.</b>

14:39.420 --> 14:41.000
<b>I will submit to the scorn.</b>

14:41.710 --> 14:43.460
<b>But I will not apologize.</b>

14:44.420 --> 14:46.000
<b>Because my heart is already set.</b>

14:46.960 --> 14:49.750
<b>I've found something for which there is no substitute.</b>

14:51.080 --> 14:54.330
<b>And it's all that I need anymore.</b>

14:57.000 --> 15:01.250
<b>I finally have an opportunity to learn
about all the things aside from love.</b>

15:02.420 --> 15:05.210
<b>I want to know. And so I won't let go.</b>

15:05.460 --> 15:06.330
<b>Thus...</b>

15:07.290 --> 15:08.960
<b>I must defile you all.</b>

15:14.790 --> 15:16.330
<b>Now bow before me!</b>

15:23.630 --> 15:25.420
<b>HESTIAAAAAAA!</b>

15:28.130 --> 15:31.330
<b>You will heed my every word.</b>

15:38.330 --> 15:39.670
<b>Where am I?</b>

15:42.130 --> 15:44.790
<b>Oh, right! I got attacked by Mr. Ottarl...</b>

15:49.420 --> 15:51.080
<b>The knife I got from Goddess Hestia is gone.</b>

15:51.580 --> 15:53.210
<b>Where the heck am I right now?</b>

15:53.790 --> 15:55.080
<b>And is Ms. Ryu okay?</b>

16:10.420 --> 16:12.880
<b>For starters, I'll look around for Ms. Ryu.</b>

16:13.130 --> 16:15.000
<b>I just hope that nobody notices me...</b>

16:15.000 --> 16:16.460
<b>What are you doing?</b>

16:17.000 --> 16:18.170
<b>M-Master...</b>

16:18.960 --> 16:21.330
<b>Wash that filthy face of yours immediately.</b>

16:21.670 --> 16:22.880
<b>It's time for breakfast.</b>

16:22.880 --> 16:23.460
<b>Huh?</b>

16:26.080 --> 16:27.500
<b>Hurry up, harebrain.</b>

16:27.960 --> 16:29.330
<b>Y-yes, Master!</b>

16:30.130 --> 16:31.380
<b>What is going on?</b>

16:39.040 --> 16:39.580
<b>Hey.</b>

16:40.670 --> 16:41.710
<b>Hurry and sit down.</b>

16:41.960 --> 16:44.380
<b>You only just woke up? Oversleeper.</b>

16:44.790 --> 16:47.290
<b>Look at this big shot! Showing up whenever he wants!</b>

16:48.630 --> 16:49.960
<b>Tis a fine dawn.</b>

16:49.960 --> 16:50.580
<b>Huh?</b>

16:50.920 --> 16:53.330
<b>Will you not shed the chains upon your gluttony?</b>

16:53.790 --> 16:55.330
<b>Uh... what?</b>

16:55.920 --> 17:00.130
<b>Quit standing there like a friggin' wall!
Sit your ass down and eat, then go to the courtyard.</b>

17:00.380 --> 17:01.630
<b>C-courtyard?</b>

17:02.710 --> 17:05.420
<b>Um, sorry! But where exactly am I right now?</b>

17:05.580 --> 17:07.380
<b>And why are you treating me like this?</b>

17:07.380 --> 17:10.920
<b>You should know. This is our home, the Fólkvangr.</b>

17:11.380 --> 17:13.420
<b>But why would you bring me here?</b>

17:14.000 --> 17:15.580
<b>What did you attack me for?</b>

17:16.290 --> 17:18.710
<b>And what about Ms. Ryu? Is she okay?!</b>

17:20.170 --> 17:22.790
<b>You are quite the contrary to a captive damsel.</b>

17:23.040 --> 17:25.000
<b>There is no purpose for which we would abduct you.</b>

17:25.210 --> 17:27.080
<b>You still asleep or what, dumbass?</b>

17:27.420 --> 17:31.830
<b>Apart from the usual training, there's no possible
reason we would have to attack you.</b>

17:32.170 --> 17:34.290
<b>Nothing you've said makes any sense.</b>

17:34.580 --> 17:37.540
<b>You're the one who Lady Freya
fell in love with at first sight.</b>

17:38.130 --> 17:40.330
<b>A fellow member of the Freya Familia.</b>

17:41.880 --> 17:45.040
<b>Wh-what the? What are you saying?!</b>

17:45.460 --> 17:47.330
<b>I'm a member of the Hestia Familia!</b>

17:47.710 --> 17:49.250
<b>I'm not one of Lady Freya's children!</b>

17:49.670 --> 17:51.830
<b>What kind of bullshit are you spouting, punk?!</b>

17:51.830 --> 17:56.580
<b>Hold on. I know this rabbit can be silly, but even
he wouldn't forget the respect due to our Goddess.</b>

17:56.790 --> 17:59.250
<b>Either bedlam dominates his remembrance,</b>

17:59.250 --> 18:02.210
<b>or perhaps a malignant spell has been laid upon him.</b>

18:02.540 --> 18:06.250
<b>I was saved by Goddess Hestia
when she took me under her wing!</b>

18:06.500 --> 18:08.170
<b>I don't have any connections to Lady Freya!</b>

18:08.500 --> 18:09.880
<b>And I never underwent a conversion!</b>

18:10.130 --> 18:10.630
<b>Yikes.</b>

18:10.630 --> 18:11.170
<b>What?</b>

18:11.170 --> 18:12.040
<b>Are you crazy?</b>

18:12.500 --> 18:14.040
<b>Think back very carefully.</b>

18:14.460 --> 18:17.080
<b>When you first came to Orario,
the only Goddess who bestowed you with a blessing...</b>

18:17.330 --> 18:18.580
<b>was Lady Freya, wasn't it?</b>

18:26.250 --> 18:30.290
<b>What kind of sick joke is this?!
They can't seriously think I'm part of the Freya Familia!</b>

18:34.380 --> 18:36.040
<b>I need to get back to my real home fast!</b>

18:36.290 --> 18:40.250
<b>Goddess Hestia, Lili, Welf, Ms. Mikoto,
and Ms. Haruhime are waiting!</b>

18:40.540 --> 18:42.580
<b>I'll ask them to help me rescue Ms. Ryu!</b>

18:44.380 --> 18:47.250
<b>Hey, that hurt! Watch where you're going, jackass!</b>

18:48.170 --> 18:49.750
<b>Ah, you're Mr. Mord!</b>

18:49.880 --> 18:53.330
<b>Oh shit, Rabbit's Foot! From the Freya Familia!</b>

18:53.670 --> 18:56.670
<b>S-sorry. I didn't realize who I was talking to!</b>

18:56.670 --> 18:58.290
<b>I wasn't trying to pick a fight!</b>

18:58.790 --> 19:02.080
<b>What are you talking about?
I'm not part of the Freya Familia.</b>

19:02.080 --> 19:04.080
<b>Mord! Give him money!</b>

19:04.460 --> 19:06.420
<b>Empty your pockets and maybe he'll let us go!</b>

19:06.830 --> 19:09.460
<b>What do you think you're doing?!
I don't need any money!</b>

19:10.040 --> 19:12.000
<b>Then what the hell am I supposed to do?!</b>

19:12.920 --> 19:15.040
<b>All goes according to her divine will.</b>

19:15.420 --> 19:17.000
<b>With the exception of that harebrain,</b>

19:17.000 --> 19:20.750
<b>all the other Gods and townsfolk have been charmed
and had their memories altered.</b>

19:21.290 --> 19:23.250
<b>So his confusion is understandable.</b>

19:23.580 --> 19:25.290
<b>Don't you remember me, Mr. Mord?</b>

19:25.630 --> 19:28.670
<b>You used to pick on me and
make all these weird comments,</b>

19:29.080 --> 19:32.290
<b>but you've helped me out when
I needed it! I'm Bell Cranel!</b>

19:32.630 --> 19:35.380
<b>That's never happened! No way, man!</b>

19:35.580 --> 19:37.580
<b>You gotta let him off the hook, please!</b>

19:37.580 --> 19:39.040
<b>He didn't mean to offend you!</b>

19:39.710 --> 19:43.420
<b>They've lost all memory of him
as a member of the Hestia Familia.</b>

19:43.420 --> 19:46.670
<b>Instead, they now recognize him
as belonging to our Familia.</b>

19:47.080 --> 19:48.880
<b>Her innate ability is most formidable.</b>

19:49.170 --> 19:51.960
<b>She was able to alter the Lower World
without using any divine power,</b>

19:51.960 --> 19:54.250
<b>and exert control over the very souls of the populace.</b>

19:54.880 --> 19:57.290
<b>All are slaves before the might of Lady Freya.</b>

19:57.540 --> 19:59.830
<b>However, her charm has no effect on him.</b>

19:59.830 --> 20:03.500
<b>And so, she had to distort everything around him
instead.</b>

20:04.000 --> 20:06.210
<b>Please! You have to remember!</b>

20:06.500 --> 20:07.830
<b>I'm with the Hestia Familia!</b>

20:07.830 --> 20:09.080
<b>What is all this about?!</b>

20:12.420 --> 20:13.250
<b>Ms. Eina!</b>

20:14.170 --> 20:17.210
<b>I beg your pardon. Have we met somewhere before?</b>

20:17.670 --> 20:21.500
<b>Huh? It's me. You don't remember... who I am?</b>

20:21.960 --> 20:26.000
<b>Don't be silly! There is nobody in Orario
who isn't familiar with your reputation!</b>

20:26.380 --> 20:30.250
<b>It's just, this is the first time we've actually met,
so I was surprised to hear you say my name.</b>

20:30.670 --> 20:33.630
<b>But you're my advisor at the Guild, isn't that right?</b>

20:33.960 --> 20:35.830
<b>Who me? Really?</b>

20:36.540 --> 20:39.210
<b>The Freya Familia has their own unique in-house policy,</b>

20:39.210 --> 20:42.080
<b>and they don't make use of
the advisor system as far as I know...</b>

20:44.750 --> 20:47.250
<b>The rabbit has been plunged into wonderland.</b>

20:48.210 --> 20:49.630
<b>Uh, Mister Cranel?!</b>

20:50.670 --> 20:53.960
<b>No! No! No!</b>

20:54.500 --> 20:56.750
<b>I am NOT part of the Freya Familia!</b>

20:57.080 --> 20:59.960
<b>Stop it! Quit looking at me like that!</b>

21:00.420 --> 21:04.460
<b>No matter how wildly he scampers,
none shall chase the rabbit.</b>

21:05.420 --> 21:06.830
<b>It's a solitary world.</b>

21:09.880 --> 21:10.830
<b>Goddess!</b>

21:12.880 --> 21:13.750
<b>You guys!</b>

21:14.500 --> 21:17.580
<b>Aren't you... that rookie with the Freya Familia?</b>

21:17.880 --> 21:22.330
<b>What business does the up-and-coming Rabbit's Foot
have to do with a minor Familia like ours?</b>

21:26.250 --> 21:29.380
<b>Goddess Hestia... not you, too...</b>

21:40.580 --> 21:44.130
<b>Let's go. We should keep our distance
from the Freya Familia.</b>

21:53.000 --> 21:56.290
<b>Goddess Hestia... please no...!</b>

21:57.420 --> 21:59.380
<b>I'm sorry, Bell...</b>

22:00.170 --> 22:02.750
<b>I'm so sorry. Forgive me.</b>

22:18.920 --> 22:21.540
<b>This secret sinks</b>

22:21.540 --> 22:24.000
<b>Into the undulating water's surface</b>

22:24.420 --> 22:28.580
<b>There was apparently enough room to notice</b>

22:29.420 --> 22:36.080
<b>Though unable to express them clearly, my pure-white feelings</b>

22:36.080 --> 22:39.250
<b>Once again become desires when called out</b>

22:39.250 --> 22:44.250
<b>These eager emotions surge just like waves</b>

22:44.630 --> 22:49.830
<b>Swelling up unknowingly with a gentle tingle</b>

22:50.920 --> 22:57.460
<b>And after the wall dividing us crumbled, the words I understood</b>

22:57.580 --> 23:01.920
<b>Simply float unsteadily in the sky</b>

23:02.420 --> 23:07.960
<b>I want a love that grows bountiful even if it's empty</b>

23:08.210 --> 23:13.540
<b>If this is a dream I might as well take the lies out, too</b>

23:13.540 --> 23:17.210
<b>Even a life that cannot be stolen</b>

23:17.330 --> 23:22.790
<b>Changes the heart by filling it a little</b>

23:23.080 --> 23:28.750
<b>An innocent mist that's like a dizzy spell</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>Orario</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>Distorted City</b>

23:36.790 --> 23:38.880
<b>Next time: "Orario".</b>
